sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant Q as GraphQL Gateway
    participant O as orders
    participant K as clients
    participant I as inventory
    participant P as payments
    C->>G: POST /graphql myOrders(first:10)
    G->>Q: identidad verificada
    Q->>Q: valida profundidad, costo y tamano de pagina
    Q->>O: GET /orders?limit=10
    O-->>Q: pedidos propios
    par un lote por tipo de dato
        Q->>K: GET /clients/batch?ids=...
    and
        Q->>I: GET /products/batch?ids=...
    and
        Q->>P: GET /payments?order_ids=...
    end
    Q->>Q: permisos por campo (email, stock, pago)
    Q-->>C: data + errors parciales si algun servicio falla
